#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`dental treatment` TRUE)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` `nuclear fission, nuclear fusion or radioactive contamination`
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `a sport or game in a professional capacity`)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `an organized contact sport`)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `racing, other than on foot`)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `a motor rally or competition`)
