#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `hunting on horseback`)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` (`entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `manual labor work, in business or leisure`)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `hazardous work`)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`an accident whilst engaging in` `an activity clause 5.7 does not name`)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`trekking` 5000)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`trekking` 5001)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`scuba diving` 20)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`scuba diving` 21)
#ASSERT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` `an indirect or consequential loss`
#ASSERT NOT `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from any of` `the English text` EMPTY

-- 5.2: all 22 Disabilities, "whether occurring prior to or during the Period of Insurance".
`the Disabilities clause 5.2 names` MEANS
    LIST `hemorrhoids`, `hernia`, `diseased tonsils requiring surgery`, `pathological abnormalities of nasal septum or turbinate`
       , `hyperthyroidism`, `cataracts`, `sinus conditions requiring surgery`, `endometriosis`, `tuberculosis`, `anal fistulae`
       , `cholecystitis`, `calculi of all kinds`, `urethra or bladder abnormalities or disease`, `hypertension or cardiovascular diseases`
       , `cerebrovascular accident or transient ischemic attack`, `gastric or duodenal ulcer`, `hallux valgus`, `all forms of tumors or cancer`
       , `malignancies`, `disorders of blood or bone marrow`, `diabetes mellitus`, `HIV and HIV related illness including AIDS and AIDS related conditions`
#ASSERT count `the Disabilities clause 5.2 names` EQUALS 22
#ASSERT all (GIVEN x YIELD `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the English` (`a Disability named in clause 5.2` x)) `the Disabilities clause 5.2 names`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN x YIELD `clause 5 excludes a loss arising from, reading the Vietnamese` (`a Disability named in clause 5.2` x)) `the Disabilities clause 5.2 names`

