§§ `Clause 8 — extension (English)`
GIVEN asked IS A DATE
      treated IS A BOOLEAN
      trip IS A NUMBER
      insured IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A request to extend the cover`
`a request to extend on` asked `, under treatment` treated `, a trip of` trip `days, insured for` insured MEANS
    `A request to extend the cover` WITH
        `date of asking`                                          IS asked
        `actively being treated or under the supervision of a Physician or Surgeon at the time of asking` IS treated
        `total length of the trip in days`                        IS trip
        `total days insured, the extension included`              IS insured
#ASSERT `clause 8 — extension will be granted, reading the English` `the test Certificate` (`a request to extend on` (YMD 2026 4 20) `, under treatment` FALSE `, a trip of` 180 `days, insured for` 180)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 8 — extension will be granted, reading the English` `the test Certificate` (`a request to extend on` (YMD 2026 4 20) `, under treatment` FALSE `, a trip of` 181 `days, insured for` 180)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 8 — extension will be granted, reading the English` `the test Certificate` (`a request to extend on` (YMD 2026 4 21) `, under treatment` FALSE `, a trip of` 30 `days, insured for` 30)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 8 — extension will be granted, reading the English` `the test Certificate` (`a request to extend on` (YMD 2026 4 15) `, under treatment` TRUE `, a trip of` 30 `days, insured for` 30)

