§§ `Clause 17 — arbitration`
GIVEN medical IS A BOOLEAN
      single  IS A BOOLEAN
      award   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A difference with the Company`
`a difference, medical` medical `, one arbitrator agreed` single `, an award made` award MEANS
    `A difference with the Company` WITH
        `requires medical knowledge`                              IS medical
        `the parties agreed on a single arbitrator`               IS single
        `an award has been determined`                            IS award
#ASSERT `clause 17 — the number of arbitrators` (`a difference, medical` FALSE `, one arbitrator agreed` TRUE `, an award made` FALSE) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `clause 17 — the number of arbitrators` (`a difference, medical` FALSE `, one arbitrator agreed` FALSE `, an award made` FALSE) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `clause 17 — the umpire must be a Consultant Specialist, Surgeon or Physician` (`a difference, medical` TRUE `, one arbitrator agreed` FALSE `, an award made` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `clause 17 — the Company can be liable on the difference` (`a difference, medical` FALSE `, one arbitrator agreed` FALSE `, an award made` FALSE)
#ASSERT `clause 17 — the Company can be liable on the difference` (`a difference, medical` FALSE `, one arbitrator agreed` FALSE `, an award made` TRUE)

§ `Travel Flex and Annual Travel`

§§ `Travel Flex — up to 5 days`
GIVEN cause IS A `Cause of a Travel Flex delay`
      n     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A Travel Flex delay`
`a Travel Flex delay by` cause `needing` n `days` MEANS
    `A Travel Flex delay` WITH
        `cause`                                                   IS cause
        `outside the control of the Insured Person`               IS TRUE
        `days to complete the journey by the next available and convenient transportation` IS n
`a Travel Flex Certificate` MEANS `a 20-day Certificate for` `Plan A` `Travel Flex`
#ASSERT `Travel Flex — the days of free extension` `a Travel Flex Certificate` (`a Travel Flex delay by` `the Insured Person required to suspend the trip on the advice of a registered medical practitioner` `needing` 3 `days`) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `Travel Flex — the days of free extension` `a Travel Flex Certificate` (`a Travel Flex delay by` `the Insured Person required to suspend the trip on the advice of a registered medical practitioner` `needing` 8 `days`) EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `Travel Flex — the days of free extension` `the test Certificate` (`a Travel Flex delay by` `the Insured Person required to suspend the trip on the advice of a registered medical practitioner` `needing` 3 `days`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Travel Flex — the days of free extension` `a Travel Flex Certificate` (`a Travel Flex delay by` `another cause` `needing` 3 `days`) EQUALS 0

