§§ `AT 3 — cancelling an Annual Travel policy`
GIVEN by IS A `Party to the Policy`
      notice IS A DATE
      cancelled IS A DATE
      claimed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A cancellation of an Annual Travel Policy`
`a cancellation by` by `, notice on` notice `, cancelled on` cancelled `, a claim arisen` claimed MEANS
    `A cancellation of an Annual Travel Policy` WITH
        `cancelled by`                                            IS by
        `date of the notice`                                      IS notice
        `notice by registered letter`                             IS TRUE
        `date of cancellation`                                    IS cancelled
        `a claim has arisen during the current Period of Insurance` IS claimed
        `the current Policy and coverage card returned on or before the date of cancellation` IS TRUE
-- By the Company on 15 March, 73 days in force of 365: 2,000,000 - 2,000,000 x 73/365.
#ASSERT `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Company` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, a claim arisen` FALSE) EQUALS 1_600_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Company` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 3 10) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 3 15) `, a claim arisen` FALSE)
-- By the Policyholder: 1 February is within the first month (20%); 14 February is in the
-- second (30%); 15 October is past eight months (100%).
#ASSERT `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Policyholder` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 1 20) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, a claim arisen` FALSE) EQUALS 1_600_000
#ASSERT `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Policyholder` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 2 14) `, a claim arisen` FALSE) EQUALS 1_400_000
#ASSERT `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Policyholder` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 10 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 10 15) `, a claim arisen` FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Policyholder` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 2 14) `, a claim arisen` TRUE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `AT 3 — the refund on cancellation` `an Annual Travel Certificate` (`a cancellation by` `the Insured Person` `, notice on` (YMD 2026 2 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 2 14) `, a claim arisen` FALSE)

