#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the English text` `the test case, returned on 15 April` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Illness on 5 April` `of` (LIST `a follow-up at home of` 40_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 7 15)) `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 0
