        `Medical Expenses`              IS JUST 120_000_000
        `Hospital Cash Allowance`       IS JUST 20_000_000
        `Personal Accident sum insured` IS JUST 1_000_000_000
        `Baggage and Personal Effects`  IS JUST 50_000_000
        `Baggage Delay`                 IS JUST 10_000_000
        `Loss of Travel Document`       IS JUST 15_000_000
        `Personal Money`                IS JUST 10_000_000
`the layered medical case` MEANS
    `a case of` (`a Certificate for` `Plan A` `a product the wording does not name` `from` (YMD 2026 4 1) `to` (YMD 2026 4 20) `with` `limits with 120 million for Medical Expenses`) `the test Insured Person` (`a trip for` `leisure travel` `departing` (YMD 2026 4 1) `returning` (JUST (YMD 2026 4 15)) `, with an insured adult` FALSE)
`the layered expenses` MEANS
    LIST `an expense of` `hospital room and board, charged on a per diem basis` 8_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 6)
       , `an expense of` `surgery` 12_000_000 `against customary charges of` 10_000_000 `where incurred and` 10_000_000 `where paid`
       , `a follow-up at home of` 140_000_000 `on` (YMD 2026 5 1)
#ASSERT `1A — the amount payable` `the English text` `the layered medical case` (`a Medical Expenses claim for` `an Illness on 5 April` `of` `the layered expenses` `unable to return` FALSE) EQUALS 120_000_000

